OL,3,GNEWSA'We have helped 100 new authors
OL,4,Aget into book shops'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crime writer who has benefitted from
OL,7,Fa scheme that helps new authors has
OL,8,Fsaid it is "restoring the connection"
OL,9,Fbetween books and local communities.
OL,11,FThe 1in200 scheme was launched in 2025
OL,12,Fby writers Colin Wade, from Headington,
OL,13,Fand Laury Conn, from Abingdon, to help
OL,14,F"self-published and small-press
OL,15,Fauthors" in Oxfordshire and
OL,16,FBuckinghamshire get discovered.
OL,18,FWade and Conn said it had already
OL,19,Fhelped more than 100 authors get their
OL,20,Fbooks "prominently displayed" in
OL,21,Findependent bookstores and coffee shops
OL,22,Fon a branded 1in200 shelf space.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
